    pr_ref:  # c910
    description: "**Defect.** The `metrics.debug` block emits an undocumented third key.\n\n**Evidence.** Spec §942 documents metrics.debug as carrying two non-canonical file counts; the producer emits three — analyzed_file_symbols, profile_files_sum, unique_paths_in_analysis — where profile_files_sum (=1218, the value total_files was supposed to be) is undocumented.\n\n**Contract.** The debug block should carry exactly the documented set of keys, or the extra key should be documented.\n\n**Consequence.** A consumer reading the documented debug block encounters an extra key with no contract and cannot tell whether it is a stable field or transient noise; schema/spec-driven validation of the debug block is incomplete."  # c910
    fields: {}  # c910
