- op: discuss  # a39b
  at: '2026-07-30T17:20:25Z'  # a39b
  by: agent  # a39b
  actor: jgstern_agent  # a39b
  clock: 3  # a39b
  nonce: a39b  # a39b
  message: "DONE — spec-only. metrics.debug was described as carrying 'two' non-canonical file counts while emitting three; profile_files_sum was undocumented.\n\nVerified on a fresh self-survey: metrics.debug = {analyzed_file_symbols, profile_files_sum, unique_paths_in_analysis}.\n\nDocumented WITH the property that makes it non-interchangeable with its neighbour, which is the point of documenting it at all: profile_files_sum sums profile.languages[*].files and therefore counts a file once per language that claims it, so it OVER-counts relative to unique_paths_in_analysis, which de-duplicates by path. A consumer that treated the three as alternative spellings of the same quantity would silently pick the wrong one; the spec now says which is which."  # a39b
